{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555890/extras/0a24566915a32eef507eaa10b48460fa.avif?t=1746552324\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s a rumor about strange, scary monsters hiding in the Magic Academy. No one has really seen them, but the school\u2019s headmaster is super worried. So, they posted a job to find these monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re just a broke college student who accidentally took the job! You don\u2019t know anything about magic, but now you\u2019ve gotta survive, solve weird problems, and catch some monsters to get that reward money!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be a Little Detective!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to funny characters, do missions, and play mini-games to help people with their magic troubles. When you help them, they\u2019ll give you cool magical items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555890/extras/beab6876407384c7936662577293ad6c.poster.avif?t=1746552324\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555890/extras/beab6876407384c7936662577293ad6c.webm?t=1746552324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555890/extras/beab6876407384c7936662577293ad6c.mp4?t=1746552324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Your Own Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find magical stuff around the school, mix them the right way, and summon your very own cute (or creepy) monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555890/extras/f7e4332eb29b0695d71e43a6dd542561.poster.avif?t=1746552324\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555890/extras/f7e4332eb29b0695d71e43a6dd542561.webm?t=1746552324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555890/extras/f7e4332eb29b0695d71e43a6dd542561.mp4?t=1746552324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore with Your Monster Buddies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your monsters with you and explore the school! Find hidden stories, secrets, and lots of magical adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555890?t=1746552324","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555890?t=1746552324","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555890/34e58444239ed4b9b8518cd77637abafa1b769d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746552324","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555890/34e58444239ed4b9b8518cd77637abafa1b769d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746552324","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555890/extras/0a24566915a32eef507eaa10b48460fa.avif?t=1746552324\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s a rumor about strange, scary monsters hiding in the Magic Academy. No one has really seen them, but the school\u2019s headmaster is super worried. So, they posted a job to find these monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re just a broke college student who accidentally took the job! You don\u2019t know anything about magic, but now you\u2019ve gotta survive, solve weird problems, and catch some monsters to get that reward money!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be a Little Detective!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to funny characters, do missions, and play mini-games to help people with their magic troubles. When you help them, they\u2019ll give you cool magical items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555890/extras/beab6876407384c7936662577293ad6c.poster.avif?t=1746552324\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555890/extras/beab6876407384c7936662577293ad6c.webm?t=1746552324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555890/extras/beab6876407384c7936662577293ad6c.mp4?t=1746552324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make Your Own Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find magical stuff around the school, mix them the right way, and summon your very own cute (or creepy) monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555890/extras/f7e4332eb29b0695d71e43a6dd542561.poster.avif?t=1746552324\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555890/extras/f7e4332eb29b0695d71e43a6dd542561.webm?t=1746552324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555890/extras/f7e4332eb29b06